*> vybe-test: cobol/category_call_returning/test_call_ret_address_of
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_category_call_returning.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256). 01 R USAGE POINTER. 01 V PIC X. PROCEDURE DIVISION. CALL 'S1' USING V RETURNING R. IF R = ADDRESS OF V DISPLAY 'Y' END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING 'Y' DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "Y"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [Y] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. S1. DATA DIVISION. LINKAGE SECTION. 01 P PIC X. 01 RR USAGE POINTER. PROCEDURE DIVISION USING P RETURNING RR. SET RR TO ADDRESS OF P. EXIT PROGRAM. END PROGRAM S1.

